    "title": {
      "rendered": "About Us"
    },
    "content": {
      "rendered": "\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">About Srh Solar</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">SRH Green Energy Pvt. Ltd. started with a vision of providing affordable solar power inefficient and sustainable method.  We understand that exploiting solar energy can give us a better and cost-effective future. We provide reliable solar energy solutions to our customers globally as we have an in-house team of engineering, operations, maintenance, and installation. Our products are designed to the highest excellence of quality, reliability, and performance. Our in-house team has 5+ years of experience in ever-evolving solar technology space. SRH Green Energy Pvt. Ltd. will take care of all the installation and maintenance for hassle-free solar power at your place. We at SRH, commit you the high yield and long-term service. Let’s collaborate with nature.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We are building a sustainable future through renewable green energy solutions. India&#8217;s premium EPC and O&amp;M solar power company. We are a global leader in the solar energy market. SRH Solar is a Rural, Commercial and Domestic Solar Company.<br>SRH Solar company offers On-Grid, Off-Grid, Hybrid Solar, Solar Water Heaters, Solar Water Pumps, Solar Street Lights, solar panels, supplies, and installation services</p>\n",
      "protected": false
    },
    "excerpt": {
      "rendered": "<p>About Srh Solar SRH Green Energy Pvt. Ltd. started with a vision of providing affordable solar power inefficient and sustainable method.  We understand that exploiting solar energy can give us a better and cost-effective future. We provide reliable solar energy solutions to our customers globally as we have an in-house team of engineering, operations, maintenance, [&hellip;]</p>\n",
